{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the Hsu UI design tokens.",
    "",
    "Two consumers read this file and must never drift apart:",
    "  1. scripts/gen-tokens-scss.cjs emits src/styles/tokens.scss (the --vita-* CSS variables)",
    "  2. src/styles/tokens.ts turns it into antd's `theme.token` object",
    "",
    "It is JSON rather than TS precisely so the generator can read it without a TS runtime, and",
    "it must stay plain values: antd derives 10-step palettes from colorPrimary via",
    "@ant-design/colors, which needs a real colour — a `var(--vita-primary)` string would break",
    "the derivation. That is why the CSS-variable layer is generated *from* here and not the",
    "other way round.",
    "",
    "Palette follows shadcn/ui's zinc scale; the brand accent stays configurable."
  ],
  "primary": "#1677ff",
  "light": {
    "background": "#fafafa",
    "surface": "#ffffff",
    "muted": "#f4f4f5",
    "border": "#e4e4e7",
    "borderWeak": "#f4f4f5",
    "foreground": "#09090b",
    "mutedForeground": "#71717a",
    "subtleForeground": "#a1a1aa",
    "hover": "#f4f4f5",
    "success": "#16a34a",
    "warning": "#f59e0b",
    "error": "#dc2626",
    "shadow1": "0 1px 2px 0 rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.05)",
    "shadow2": "0 4px 6px -1px rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.08), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.06)",
    "shadow3": "0 10px 15px -3px rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.08)"
  },
  "dark": {
    "background": "#09090b",
    "surface": "#18181b",
    "muted": "#27272a",
    "border": "#27272a",
    "borderWeak": "#1f1f23",
    "foreground": "#fafafa",
    "mutedForeground": "#a1a1aa",
    "subtleForeground": "#71717a",
    "hover": "#27272a",
    "success": "#22c55e",
    "warning": "#fbbf24",
    "error": "#f87171",
    "shadow1": "0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)",
    "shadow2": "0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)",
    "shadow3": "0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)"
  },
  "radius": {
    "xs": 4,
    "sm": 6,
    "base": 8,
    "lg": 12
  },
  "font": {
    "family": "system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif",
    "sizeSm": 12,
    "size": 14,
    "sizeLg": 16
  },
  "control": {
    "height": 32,
    "heightSm": 24,
    "heightLg": 40,
    "ringWidth": 2
  },
  "modalWidth": {
    "sm": 600,
    "md": 800,
    "lg": 1200
  },
  "breakpoint": {
    "sm": 640,
    "md": 768,
    "lg": 1024,
    "xl": 1280,
    "xxl": 1536
  }
}
